":12,"source_sha256":"9f61443caef5afc9ccfbfe7d2a986a1bbd73c6c7056bfa2f76898a7896e28510","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":13},{"dia_id":"D12:14","global_turn_index":218,"locator":"[S12T14]","raw_turn_sha256":"4478cfc829ef2f3a3c6a667180f352b77d2eaaf95e7ed0f36eeb0178abc28406","rendered_turn_sha256":"f4c1a61881d2e751879ca4f1325d8ecab505a97f9ba2ccabca8409a5099f3c1b","session_date":"2023-08-03","session_datetime":"2023-08-03T13:12:00","session_id":"session_12","session_index":12,"source_sha256":"9f44500b5cf8d9d7dcfd80817d900da87739e938ebf74d76c7b1293cd1871c57","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":14},{"dia_id":"D12:15","global_turn_index":219,"locator":"[S12T15]","raw_turn_sha256":"2394b272a61c4a18b794b9256c8f12d54f589b5b806afb290c1d4407376455cb","rendered_turn_sha256":"f56a129b4adb309f227143c6bd46956cd42e5aacc8f70699e1ad9d1cb5a73be3","session_date":"2023-08-03","session_datetime":"2023-08-03T13:12:00","session_id":"session_12","session_index":12,"source_sha256":"7ba64ca26cdd19cf8084ca266b2369ce2d7e1371083c4a3a4e872e4b098b7c37","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":15},{"dia_id":"D12:16","global_turn_index":220,"locator":"[S12T16]","raw_turn_sha256":"9530d408d7f86766cfedcbc6fff13db9acb333280ebb02a30cc33249affdea72","rendered_turn_sha256":"2bf8be581389f072efbd43d072c350414dea4bdb224724730bb93ff637e08058","session_date":"2023-08-03","session_datetime":"2023-08-03T13:12:00","session_id":"session_12","session_index":12,"source_sha256":"f3c889f8efd2701b197e491c8e02964716c8ddaeb318d42f9cbd3e6bab5cf860","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":16}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Aww, that's cool, Dave. Reminiscing is always fun! That pic you shared takes me back to my trip to the Ferrari dealership. I saw a lot of amazing cars, but as for me, my car is the best and  I'm pretty proud of this. Sure, it's just material, but it reminds me of my hard work and dedication. It really inspires me. Take a look at this beauty!\n[Image caption: a photography of a red car is lifted on a lift in a garage]\n[S12T7] (dia_id: D12:7)\n\nDave: Your car looks great, Calvin! I can tell why you're proud. Having something like that is motivating. It's like a reminder of what you can achieve.\n[S12T8] (dia_id: D12:8)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Seeing it everyday keeps me motivated and reminds me to keep pushing.\n[S12T9] (dia_id: D12:9)\n\nDave: Sounds like you're really motivated, Calvin. What's the biggest goal you're working towards, music-wise or something else?\n[S12T10] (dia_id: D12:10)\n\nCalvin: My plan for now is to expand my brand worldwide and grow my fanbase. I want my music to reach more people and make an impact. Working with artists from around the globe and challenging myself to create special music are goals of mine too. Look at the photo of how I performed with the boys last night, they are great at the music!\n[Image caption: a photo of a band playing on stage with lights on]\n[S12T11] (dia_id: D12:11)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Working with different artists and crafting great sounds will definitely help you reach your goals. Keep it up and keep making a difference!\n[S12T12] (dia_id: D12:12)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! Your support and encouragement mean a lot to me. I'm determined to make my dreams come true.\n[S12T13] (dia_id: D12:13)\n\nDave: Glad to help, Calvin! Eager to see what you do. Keep at it and never forget your dreams!\n[S12T14] (dia_id: D12:14)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I appreciate your support, it means a lot to me. I'll keep going for my dreams.\n[S12T15] (dia_id: D12:15)\n\nDave: No problem, Calvin! Just remember to stay focused and keep going. You've got this!\n[S12T16] (dia_id: D12:16)","text_sha256":"6457618eaff1f3a767997fc74a13f0dbe567233ac4b903514822c233d9b3189b","timestamp":"2023-08-03T13:12:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D18:3"],"kind":"raw_turn"