ting happening in the world of music for you?\n[S6T10] (dia_id: D6:10)\n\nCalvin: Thanks Dave! Super excited for my upcoming performance in Tokyo this month. It's gonna be great to show my music to a whole new crowd and hopefully expand my following!\n[S6T11] (dia_id: D6:11)\n\nDave: Cool, Cal! Doing a show in Tokyo, wow! I'm sure the audience is gonna love it. Wishing you all the luck! Let me know how it goes.\n[S6T12] (dia_id: D6:12)\n\nCalvin: Sure thing, Dave! I'll keep you posted on how it goes. Thanks for the good luck! Look what a wonderful night! \n\n[Image caption: a photo of a city at night with a lot of lights]\n[S6T13] (dia_id: D6:13)\n\nDave: That looks great! Where did you snap that pic?\n[S6T14] (dia_id: D6:14)\n\nCalvin: I took that pic in Tokyo last night. The skyline was stunning!\n[S6T15] (dia_id: D6:15)\n\nDave: Wow, great shot! The night skyline really pops with those city lights. I gotta take a trip there soon!\n[S6T16] (dia_id: D6:16)","text_sha256":"fdf83900473b81da37ab81a4a6884b6b4f3df0fdeb487dd16f410afe032fa658","timestamp":"2023-05-16T11:50:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":578,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":13851,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":14429},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha25